# Checks the real Twitch lookups with a manual login: the logged-in channel's name, and that entwicklerwg resolves.
# Log in by hand under Options, Modding, Twitch when the game is up.

launch A
A wait ready=1 timeout=240
A realinput on
A wait named=1 timeout=900
A state
A twitch_user entwicklerwg
A expect state contains "lookup=entwicklerwg/" timeout=30
A state
